0cb68c8385","colab":{}},"source":["a = np.array([[1,2,3],[4,5,6]])\n","b = np.array([[6,5,4],[3,2,1]])\n","\n","print(a)\n","print(b)\n","print(\"--\")\n","\n","print(\"a+b\\n\",a+b)\n","print(\"a**2\\n\", a**2)\n","print(\"a*b\\n\",a*b)\n","print(\"a x b'\\n\",a.dot(b.T))\n","print(\"a' x b\\n\",a.T.dot(b))\n"],"execution_count":0,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","text":["[[1 2 3]\n"," [4 5 6]]\n","[[6 5 4]\n"," [3 2 1]]\n","--\n","a+b\n"," [[7 7 7]\n"," [7 7 7]]\n","a**2\n"," [[ 1  4  9]\n"," [16 25 36]]\n","a*b\n"," [[ 6 10 12]\n"," [12 10  6]]\n","a x b'\n"," [[28 10]\n"," [73 28]]\n","a' x b\n"," [[18 13  8]\n"," [27 20 13]\n"," [36 27 18]]\n"],"name":"stdout"}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"B-BN4fTbzrqd","colab_type":"text"},"source":["### Vectorization\n","\n","Vectorization is used to speed up the Python code without using **loop** structures. For instance, the dot product (inner product) between two vector: \n","$$a_{1 \\times n} \\cdot b_{n\\times 1} = c$$\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"TTj-idSszrqf","colab_type":"code","outputId":"2ca322ac-3fb2-44ca-9472-a242608613af","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1590523305965,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":628,"user":{"displayName":"Fabio Martinez Carrillo","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GiUBl7ekqkSkHaJqFt9lDIzmMMymwp2pFX7Xu03tA=s64","userId":"13325158328880210155"}},"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":50}},"source":["import time \n","a = np.random.randint(10, size=10000)\n","b = np.random.randint(10, size=10000)\n","\n","tic = time.process_time() \n","dot = 0.0; \n","  \n","for i in range(len(a)): \n","      dot += a[i] * b[i] \n","\n","toc = time.process_time() \n","print(\"dot_product = \"+ str(dot)); \n","print(\"Computation time = \" + str(1000*(toc - tic )) + \"ms\") "],"execution_count":0,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","text":["dot_product = 202728.0\n","Computation time = 10.458284000000262ms\n"],"name":"stdout"}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"Vua8q7Auzrqn","colab_type":"text"},"source":["Now, we can use the vectorized way"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"5s3NRadHzrqp","colab_type":"code","outputId":"9b400ff8-f7b2-4d0e-da06-1999d785ffae","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1590523350460,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":649,"user":{"displayName":"Fabio Martinez Carrillo","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GiUBl7ekqkSkHaJqFt9lDIzmMMymwp2pFX7Xu03tA=s64","userId":"13325158328880210155"}},"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":67}},"source":["n_tic = time.process_time() \n","n_dot_product = np.dot(a, b) \n","n_toc = time.process_time() \n","  \n","print(\"\\nn_dot_product = \"+str(n_dot_product)) \n","print(\"Computation time = \"+str(1000*(n_toc - n_tic ))+\"ms\") "],"execution_count":0,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","text":["\n","n_dot_product = 202728\n","Computation time = 0.14314700000017666ms\n"],"name":"stdout"}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"NSomNs1Rzrqy","colab_type":"text"},"source":["Another way, but with outer product (tensor product): \n","$$a_{n\\times1}b^{T}_{1\\times n} = c_{n\\times n}$$"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"Z96WDyMjzrq0","colab_type":"code","outputId":"20586785-64d1-436e-dec1-12ce90be6ed0","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1590523512601,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":73122,"user":{"displayName":"Fabio Martinez Carrillo","photoUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/AOh14GiUBl7ekqkSkHaJqFt9lDIzmMMymwp2pFX7Xu03tA=s64","userId":"13325158328880210155"}},"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":151}},"source":["tic = time.process_time() \n","outer_product = np.zeros((10000, 10000)) \n","  \n","for i in range(len(a)): \n","    for j in range(len(b)): \n","        outer_product[i][j]= a[i]*b[j] \n","\n","toc = time.process_time() \n","print(\"outer_product = \"+ str(outer_product)); \n","print(\"Computation time = \"+str(1000*(toc - tic ))+\"ms\") "],"execution_count":0,"outputs":[