   ],
   "source": [
    "#1. RTA:\n",
    "#numpy broadcast\n",
    "u = (2 * v) + (5 * w)\n",
    "print(u)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "colab_type": "text",
    "id": "BNPr5-4Ozrrg"
   },
   "source": [
    "Also, this mathematical expression:\n",
    "$y^i = \\sum_{j=0}^{n}\\theta_{j}^{i}x_{j}^{i}=\\Theta X^\\top; i=\\{1,2\\}$, where lowercase letters correspond to elements and uppercase letters to matrices or vectors."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {},
    "colab_type": "code",
    "id": "5HtBJ6vvzrri",
    "outputId": "46740f44-4169-4b9b-8c87-0c9c9607afbe"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[8.3  5.72]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#2\n",
    "theta = np.array([0.4,0.04,0.3,0.2,0.5])\n",
    "X = np.array([[1,5,8,9,7],\n",
    "              [1,3,4,5,6]])\n",
    "y = np.array([0.0,0.0])\n",
    "\n",
    "for m in list(range(2)):\n",
    "    result = 0\n",
    "    for n in list(range(5)):\n",
    "        result = result + (theta[n]*X[m,n])\n",
    "    y[m] = result    \n",
    "\n",
    "print(y)    "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "colab_type": "text",
    "id": "B-iEyoCBzrrp"
   },
   "source": [
    "could be replaced by:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 0,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {},
    "colab_type": "code",
    "id": "YtZ05S39zrrq",
    "outputId": "394fd6ce-472b-4dd9-831e-cb93dc76d513"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
